#. ja: やはり、先陣を切ってきたか、蛮族の英雄め……！
#. de: Hat <if $gn4>die Heldin<else>der Held</if> der Wilden also wirklich unsere Vorhut durchbrochen?
#. fr: Comme prévu... <if $gn4>L'héroïne<else>Le héros</if> des barbares mène la charge<nbsp>!
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonBorderarea_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONBORDERAREA_00000_IMPERIALGUARDRED_000_000:1"
msgid "These <i>savages</i> bested our vanguard? Impressive..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 陛下の理想を理解せぬ愚者は、ここで始末するッ！
#. de: Ich werde <if $gn4>der Unwürdigen<else>dem Unwürdigen</if> die Kehle durchschneiden!
#. fr: Puisqu'<if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> est trop stupide pour apprécier l'idéal de Sa Majesté à sa juste valeur, <if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> mourra ici<nbsp>!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonBorderarea_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONBORDERAREA_00000_IMPERIALGUARDBLUE_000_001:1"
msgid "But in the end, they are only that─savages.<br>Now, let us be brief. His Radiance awaits."
msgstr ""

#. ja: クソッ……やはり殿下を退けただけのことはあるか……！<br>時間は稼げた、一時後退するッ！
#. de: Das reicht. Seine Majestät sollte jetzt in Sicherheit sein. Rückzug!
#. fr: Hmpf<nbsp>! Pas étonnant <if $gn4>qu'elle<else>qu'il</if> entrave les plans de Sa Majesté à tous les tournants... On a gagné assez de temps<nbsp>! Repli immédiat<nbsp>!
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonBorderarea_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONBORDERAREA_00000_IMPERIALGUARDRED_000_010:1"
msgid "We have served our purpose. Come, we shall withdraw for now. "
msgstr ""
